SUMMARY:Side by Side 3: Delving into Israeli & Palestinian Narratives 
DESCRIPTION:**Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narratives
 **  \nA Conversation led by Rabbi Justus Baird  \n  \nIn this third sessio
 n of a three-part learning series\, we will explore multiple narratives of
  the last century of events in Israel/Palestine\, specifically from Israel
 i Jewish and Palestinian points of view. The goal will not be to debate th
 ose narratives nor change our own\, but simply to hear and engage with the
 m.  \n  \nThis first session will focus on Establishment of the State of I
 srael.   \nThe second session in the fall will focus on The First Intifada
 .  \n  \nPlease register so that Rabbi Justus can share materials with you
  before the class.   \n(link to come)  \n  \nParticipants should expect th
 e learning to be challenging and difficult\, emotionally and psychological
 ly.  \n  \nReading in advance of each session will be strongly encouraged.
   \n  \nJoining both sessions is recommended but not required.  \n  \nPlea
 se remember to bring your fob to access the building.  \n  \n**Questions?*
 *  \nContact the Shomrei Office  \noffice@shomrei.org  \n(973) 746-5031\n\
 n
