  Jewish and Palestinian points of view. The goal will not be to debate tho
 se narratives nor change our own\, but simply to hear and engage with them
 .  \n  \nThis first session will focus on Establishment of the State of Is
 rael.   \nThe second session in the fall will focus on The First Intifada.
