 AC  \n  \n**RSVP for Dinner:** https://www.google.com/url?q=https://shomre
 i.org/family&sa=D&source=calendar&ust=1787589009071369&usg=AOvVaw0S2RH-4A_
 Og4Bj9JlGOIhu  \n  \n**Shabbat Sha-Blue-Jeans**  \nJoin Rabbi Uri for a sp
 irited and fun Shabbat service.  \nWear your jeans and come ready to sing 
 and dance as we welcome Shabbat together!  \nOpen to all families with kid
 s in second grade and younger.  \n(Older siblings are welcome.)  \n  \n**S
 habbat Dinner**   \nFamilies are invited to join for dinner\, stay after S
 habbat Sha-Blue-Jeans or come for dinner before the JLC Family Service.   
 \nVoluntary suggested donation of $18 per family to offset costs.  \n  \n*
 *Family Kabbalat Shabbat**  \nThis is a highly participatory Kabbalat Shab
 bat.   \nGeared towards children (2nd- 7th grade) and their parents\, gran
 dparents\, and caregivers.  \nLed by Rabbi Uri\, Sarah Kamenetsky\, and th
 e students from our JLC (Jewish Learning Center)  \n  \n**Questions?**  \n
 Contact the Shomrei office\, (973) 746-5031  \nopen-door@shomrei.org\n\n
